{"type":"message","id":"c2008a3b","parentId":"29a8b9f1","timestamp":"2026-05-09T20:00:21.342Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec-1778356814534521120-16027","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Collecting pygame\n  Downloading pygame-2.6.1-cp311-cp311-manylinux_2_17_x86_64.manylinux2014_x86_64.whl.metadata (12 kB)\nDownloading pygame-2.6.1-cp311-cp311-manylinux_2_17_x86_64.manylinux2014_x86_64.whl (14.0 MB)\n   ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 14.0/14.0 MB 136.0 MB/s eta 0:00:00\nInstalling collected packages: pygame\nSuccessfully installed pygame-2.6.1\nWARNING: Running pip as the 'root' user can result in broken permissions and conflicting behaviour with the system package manager. It is recommended to use a virtual environment instead: https://pip.pypa.io/warnings/venv\n\n[notice] A new release of pip is available: 24.0 -> 26.1.1\n[notice] To update, run: pip install --upgrade pip"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1990,"aggregated":"Collecting pygame\n  Downloading pygame-2.6.1-cp311-cp311-manylinux_2_17_x86_64.manylinux2014_x86_64.whl.metadata (12 kB)\nDownloading pygame-2.6.1-cp311-cp311-manylinux_2_17_x86_64.manylinux2014_x86_64.whl (14.0 MB)\n   ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 14.0/14.0 MB 136.0 MB/s eta 0:00:00\nInstalling collected packages: pygame\nSuccessfully installed pygame-2.6.1\nWARNING: Running pip as the 'root' user can result in broken permissions and conflicting behaviour with the system package manager. It is recommended to use a virtual environment instead: https://pip.pypa.io/warnings/venv\n\n[notice] A new release of pip is available: 24.0 -> 26.1.1\n[notice] To update, run: pip install --upgrade pip","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778356821341}}
{"type":"message","id":"310d17ae","parentId":"c2008a3b","timestamp":"2026-05-09T20:00:26.350Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好的 Tom，那我就按我的节奏开工了！🐴\n\n我们使用 **Python + Pygame**。第一步，我会先搭建一个基础框架：\n1. 创建游戏窗口。\n2. 设置主循环（处理输入、更新、绘图）。\n3. 让玩家可以控制一个小坦克左右移动和转向。\n\n我会先把代码写到一个叫 `tank_game.py` 的文件里。\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"write-1778356821592396360-16028","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"import pygame\nimport sys\n\n# 游戏常量\nSCREEN_WIDTH = 800\nSCREEN_HEIGHT = 600\nFPS = 60\nCOLOR_BLACK = (0, 0, 0)\nCOLOR_WHITE = (255, 255, 255)\nTANK_SPEED = 4\n\nclass PlayerTank(pygame.sprite.Sprite):\n    def __init__(self, x, y):\n        super().__init__()\n        # 创建一个简单的坦克矩形，暂时用颜色块代替\n        self.image = pygame.Surface((40, 40))\n        self.image.fill((0, 255, 0)) # 绿色坦克\n        self.rect = self.image.get_rect()\n        self.rect.center = (x, y)\n        self.direction = \"UP\"\n\n    def update(self):\n        keys = pygame.key.get_pressed()\n        if keys[pygame.K_LEFT]:\n            self.rect.x -= TANK_SPEED\n            self.direction = \"LEFT\"\n        elif keys[pygame.K_RIGHT]:\n            self.rect.x += TANK_SPEED\n            self.direction = \"RIGHT\"\n        elif keys[pygame.K_UP]:\n            self.rect.y -= TANK_SPEED\n            self.direction = \"UP\"\n        elif keys[pygame.K_DOWN]:\n            self.rect.y += TANK_SPEED\n            self.direction = \"DOWN\"\n\n        # 边界控制\n        self.rect.clamp_ip(pygame.display.get_surface().get_rect())\n\ndef main():\n    pygame.init()\n    screen = pygame.display.set_mode((SCREEN_WIDTH, SCREEN_HEIGHT))\n    pygame.display.set_caption(\"小马坦克大战 - Tank War\")\n    clock = pygame.time.Clock()\n\n    player = PlayerTank(SCREEN_WIDTH // 2, SCREEN_HEIGHT - 50)\n    all_sprites = pygame.sprite.Group()\n    all_sprites.add(player)\n\n    running = True\n    while running:\n        # 1. 事件处理\n        for event in pygame.event.get():\n            if event.type == pygame.QUIT:\n                running = False\n\n        # 2. 更新\n        all_sprites.update()\n\n        # 3. 绘制\n        screen.fill(COLOR_BLACK)\n        all_sprites.draw(screen)\n        \n        pygame.display.flip()\n        clock.tick(FPS)\n\n    pygame.quit()\n    sys.exit()\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n","path":"tank_game.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"cli-api","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":15889,"output":714,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16603,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778356821343,"responseId":"VZL_abLMNqu-_uMPsKm3oQY"}}
