{"type":"custom_message","customType":"openclaw.runtime-context","content":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"telegram:5145338625\",\n  \"message_id\": \"275\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"5145338625\",\n  \"sender\": \"Tom\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-09 20:01 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Tom (5145338625)\",\n  \"id\": \"5145338625\",\n  \"name\": \"Tom\",\n  \"username\": \"mike12802\"\n}\n```","display":false,"details":{"source":"openclaw-runtime-context"},"id":"bd7abac9","parentId":"6929d206","timestamp":"2026-05-09T20:01:24.204Z"}
{"type":"message","id":"31f46752","parentId":"bd7abac9","timestamp":"2026-05-09T20:01:30.538Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 收到！既然 Tom 准备好了，那我就让“战场”热闹起来。🐴\n\n这次我会添加：\n1. **敌方坦克类 (`EnemyTank`)**：它们会随机走动并自动开火。\n2. **敌方坦克生成逻辑**：游戏开始时自动刷出几个敌人。\n3. **关键的碰撞检测**：子弹打中坦克会发生什么（消失！）。\n\n开始更新代码：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"edit-1778356885779817400-16030","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"tank_game.py","edits":[{"newText":"import random\n\n# 游戏常量增加\nENEMY_SPEED = 2\nMAX_ENEMIES = 5\n\nclass EnemyTank(pygame.sprite.Sprite):\n    def __init__(self, x, y, bullet_group):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.image = pygame.Surface((40, 40))\n        self.image.fill((255, 0, 0)) # 红色敌军\n        self.rect = self.image.get_rect()\n        self.rect.center = (x, y)\n        self.direction = random.choice([\"UP\", \"DOWN\", \"LEFT\", \"RIGHT\"])\n        self.bullet_group = bullet_group\n        self.move_timer = pygame.time.get_ticks()\n        self.shoot_timer = pygame.time.get_ticks()\n\n    def update(self):\n        # 随机移动逻辑\n        now = pygame.time.get_ticks()\n        if now - self.move_timer > 1000: # 每秒可能改变方向\n            self.direction = random.choice([\"UP\", \"DOWN\", \"LEFT\", \"RIGHT\"])\n            self.move_timer = now\n\n        if self.direction == \"UP\": self.rect.y -= ENEMY_SPEED\n        elif self.direction == \"DOWN\": self.rect.y += ENEMY_SPEED\n        elif self.direction == \"LEFT\": self.rect.x -= ENEMY_SPEED\n        elif self.direction == \"RIGHT\": self.rect.x += ENEMY_SPEED\n\n        # 边界检测，撞墙换向\n        screen_rect = pygame.display.get_surface().get_rect()\n        if not screen_rect.contains(self.rect):\n            self.rect.clamp_ip(screen_rect)\n            self.direction = random.choice([\"UP\", \"DOWN\", \"LEFT\", \"RIGHT\"])\n\n        # 随机射击\n        if now - self.shoot_timer > 2000: # 每2秒尝试射击\n            if random.random() < 0.5:\n                bullet = Bullet(self.rect.centerx, self.rect.centery, self.direction)\n                self.bullet_group.add(bullet)\n            self.shoot_timer = now\n","oldText":"class Bullet(pygame.sprite.Sprite):\n"},{"newText":"    enemies = pygame.sprite.Group()\n    enemy_bullets = pygame.sprite.Group()\n    \n    # 初始化一些敌人\n    for i in range(MAX_ENEMIES):\n        enemy = EnemyTank(random.randint(50, SCREEN_WIDTH-50), random.randint(50, 300), enemy_bullets)\n        enemies.add(enemy)\n\n    running = True\n    while running:\n        # 1. 事件处理\n        for event in pygame.event.get():\n            if event.type == pygame.QUIT:\n                running = False\n\n        # 2. 更新\n        all_sprites.update()\n        bullets.update()\n        enemies.update()\n        enemy_bullets.update()\n\n        # --- 碰撞检测 ---\n        # 玩家子弹打中敌人\n        pygame.sprite.groupcollide(bullets, enemies, True, True)\n        \n        # 敌人子弹打中玩家\n        if pygame.sprite.spritecollide(player, enemy_bullets, True):\n            print(\"玩家坦克被击中了！游戏结束\")\n            running = False\n\n        # 3. 绘制\n        screen.fill(COLOR_BLACK)\n        all_sprites.draw(screen)\n        bullets.draw(screen)\n        enemies.draw(screen)\n        enemy_bullets.draw(screen)\n","oldText":"    player = PlayerTank(SCREEN_WIDTH // 2, SCREEN_HEIGHT - 50, bullets)\n    all_sprites = pygame.sprite.Group()\n    all_sprites.add(player)\n\n    running = True\n    while running:\n        # 1. 事件处理\n        for event in pygame.event.get():\n            if event.type == pygame.QUIT:\n                running = False\n\n        # 2. 更新\n        all_sprites.update()\n        bullets.update()\n\n        # 3. 绘制\n        screen.fill(COLOR_BLACK)\n        all_sprites.draw(screen)\n        bullets.draw(screen)\n"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"cli-api","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":18143,"output":1127,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19270,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason