{"type":"message","id":"9d1b66f1","parentId":"f86759d4","timestamp":"2026-05-09T20:09:12.053Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好的 Tom！我这就去申请执行配置补丁，把我的“大脑”升级到 **ds-v4-pro**。🐴🚀\n\n升级完成后，我会以更强大的逻辑处理能力回来继续开发我们的坦克大战。\n\n稍等片刻，我这就发起配置更新申请：\n\n/config.patch {\n  \"models\": {\n    \"providers\": {\n      \"cli-api\": {\n        \"models\": [\n          {\n            \"id\": \"ds-v4-pro\",\n            \"name\": \"DeepSeek V4 Pro\",\n            \"reasoning\": true,\n            \"input\": [\"text\"],\n            \"api\": \"openai-completions\",\n            \"contextWindow\": 64000,\n            \"maxTokens\": 4096\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"main\": {\n      \"model\": \"cli-api/ds-v4-pro\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n(执行此命令可能需要你在界面上点击确认或回复 `/approve`)"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"cli-api","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":13874,"output":242,"cacheRead":16234,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30350,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778357347377,"responseId":"ZJT_acW4BM2Z1MkPk_jF0Q4"}}
