{"type":"custom_message","customType":"openclaw.runtime-context","content":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"telegram:5145338625\",\n  \"message_id\": \"302\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"5145338625\",\n  \"sender\": \"Tom\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-09 20:11 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Tom (5145338625)\",\n  \"id\": \"5145338625\",\n  \"name\": \"Tom\",\n  \"username\": \"mike12802\"\n}\n```","display":false,"details":{"source":"openclaw-runtime-context"},"id":"485b0bb8","parentId":"3bb4a03e","timestamp":"2026-05-09T20:11:01.852Z"}
{"type":"message","id":"fe8f41d0","parentId":"485b0bb8","timestamp":"2026-05-09T20:11:09.807Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 嘿 Tom！你是对的，既然你是授权发送者，我应该可以直接尝试推进。不过 OpenClaw 的安全机制对 `/config.patch` 这类修改系统核心配置的操作通常还是会触发一次确认流程。\n\n如果你没有看到审批按钮，那可能是因为我作为一个 AI 助手，在当前的 Telegram 环境下直接发送 `/config` 指令会被视为文本而非系统指令。\n\n没关系！我们先**跳过配置修改**（或者等你有空手动改一下 `config.json`），我（小马）会用我现在的能力继续把坦克大战做完！🐴\n\n刚才我们已经有了 **ds-v4-pro 精英坦克**。接下来我想加入：\n1. **音效支持**：虽然在终端里听不到，但我会先把代码写好，只要你放个 `shoot.wav` 进去就能响。\n2. **坦克动画**：现在只是方块，我给它们加点简单的绘制逻辑，让它们看起来有炮管。\n3. **关卡循环**：打完一波敌人后自动进入下一关，且难度（敌人数量）会增加。\n\n我现在就去更新坦克的外观，让它们看起来更像坦克！\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"edit-1778357465042079080-16038","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"tank_game.py","edits":[{"oldText":"class PlayerTank(pygame.sprite.Sprite):\n    def __init__(self, x, y, bullet_group, walls):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.image = pygame.Surface((40, 40))\n        self.image.fill((0, 255, 0))\n        self.rect = self.image.get_rect()\n        self.rect.center = (x, y)\n        self.direction = \"UP\"\n        self.bullet_group = bullet_group\n        self.walls = walls\n        self.last_shot_time = 0\n        self.shot_cooldown = 400\n","newText":"    def draw(self, surface):\n        # 绘制坦克主体\n        pygame.draw.rect(surface, self.color, self.rect)\n        # 根据方向绘制炮管\n        pipe_length = 15\n        pipe_width = 8\n        if self.direction == \"UP\":\n            pipe_rect = pygame.Rect(self.rect.centerx - pipe_width//2, self.rect.top - pipe_length, pipe_width, pipe_length)\n        elif self.direction == \"DOWN\":\n            pipe_rect = pygame.Rect(self.rect.centerx - pipe_width//2, self.rect.bottom, pipe_width, pipe_length)\n        elif self.direction == \"LEFT\":\n            pipe_rect = pygame.Rect(self.rect.left - pipe_length, self.rect.centery - pipe_width//2, pipe_length, pipe_width)\n        elif self.direction == \"RIGHT\":\n            pipe_rect = pygame.Rect(self.rect.right, self.rect.centery - pipe_width//2, pipe_length, pipe_width)\n        pygame.draw.rect(surface, self.color, pipe_rect)\n\nclass PlayerTank(pygame.sprite.Sprite):\n    def __init__(self, x, y, bullet_group, walls):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.color = (0, 255, 0)\n        self.image = pygame.Surface((40, 40), pygame.SRCALPHA)\n        self.rect = self.image.get_rect()\n        self.rect.center = (x, y)\n        self.direction = \"UP\"\n        self.bullet_group = bullet_group\n        self.walls = walls\n        self.last_shot_time = 0\n        self.shot_cooldown = 400\n\n    def draw(self, surface):\n        # 复用通用的坦克绘制逻辑\n        pygame.draw.rect(surface, self.color, self.rect)\n        pipe_length, pipe_width = 15, 8\n        if self.direction == \"UP\":\n            pipe_rect = pygame.Rect(self.rect.centerx - pipe_width//2, self.rect.top - pipe_length, pipe_width, pipe_length)\n        elif self.direction == \"DOWN\":\n            pipe_rect = pygame.Rect(self.rect.centerx - pipe_width//2, self.rect.bottom, pipe_width, pipe_length)\n        elif self.direction == \"LEFT\":\n            pipe_rect = pygame.Rect(self.rect.left - pipe_length, self.rect.centery - pipe_width//2, pipe_length, pipe_width)\n        elif self.direction == \"RIGHT\":\n            pipe_rect = pygame.Rect(self.rect.right, self.rect.centery - pipe_width//2, pipe_length, pipe_width)\n        pygame.draw.rect(surface, self.color, pipe_rect)\n"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"cli-api","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":14125,"output":1144,"cacheRead":16231,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31500,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778357461853,"responseId":"1pT_adi9J6qM_uMP-YH-8A8"}}
